{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-tasks","title":"节点边图级任务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/applications/graph-tasks","wordCount":1345,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"节点边图级任务\">节点边图级任务</h1><p>学了一堆 GNN 架构，到了用的时候，第一个要问的不是「用哪个模型」，而是「这是个什么任务」。图学习的任务千变万化——预测用户会不会欺诈、两个人会不会成为好友、一个分子有没有毒——但它们其实都能归到三种范式：节点级、边级、图级。范式选错，后面的读出方式、损失函数、数据划分全会跟着错。这一篇是后两篇具体应用的「任务地图」，建立在前三章所有架构与训练知识之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三种任务范式\">核心概念：三种任务范式</h2><p>三种范式的区别在于「预测的对象是什么粒度」：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    GNN[&quot;GNN 算出节点表示 h_i&quot;] --&gt; NODE[&quot;节点级任务&lt;br/&gt;预测每个节点的标签&quot;]&#10;    GNN --&gt; EDGE[&quot;边级任务&lt;br/&gt;预测节点对之间的关系&quot;]&#10;    GNN --&gt; GRAPH[&quot;图级任务&lt;br/&gt;预测整张图的标签&quot;]&#10;    NODE --&gt; N1[&quot;欺诈检测、文档分类&quot;]&#10;    EDGE --&gt; E1[&quot;链接预测、推荐&quot;]&#10;    GRAPH --&gt; G1[&quot;分子性质、毒性预测&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    GNN[\"GNN 算出节点表示 h_i\"] --&gt; NODE[\"节点级任务&lt;br/&gt;预测每个节点的标签\"]\n    GNN --&gt; EDGE[\"边级任务&lt;br/&gt;预测节点对之间的关系\"]\n    GNN --&gt; GRAPH[\"图级任务&lt;br/&gt;预测整张图的标签\"]\n    NODE --&gt; N1[\"欺诈检测、文档分类\"]\n    EDGE --&gt; E1[\"链接预测、推荐\"]\n    GRAPH --&gt; G1[\"分子性质、毒性预测\"]</pre><p>它们对模型输出的处理方式完全不同。节点级直接用节点表示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；边级要把两个端点的表示组合起来；图级则要把所有节点表示「读出」成一个图向量。下表是这张地图的核心：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>预测对象</th>\n<th>输出处理</th>\n<th>典型损失</th>\n<th>评测指标</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>节点级</td>\n<td>单个节点</td>\n<td>直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> → 分类头</td>\n<td>交叉熵</td>\n<td>准确率、F1</td>\n<td>欺诈检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边级</td>\n<td>节点对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>组合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i, h_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>BCE（含负采样）</td>\n<td>AUC、Hits@K</td>\n<td>链接预测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图级</td>\n<td>整张图</td>\n<td>readout 汇总所有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>交叉熵/MSE</td>\n<td>准确率、ROC-AUC</td>\n<td>分子性质</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"节点级任务-分类与回归\">节点级任务：分类与回归</h2><p>节点级任务给图里每个节点一个预测。最常见的是节点分类（半监督）：<a href=\"../architectures/gcn\">GCN</a> 在 Cora 上分类论文领域就是范例——少量节点带标签，模型借助图结构把信息传播到无标签节点。工业场景里，欺诈检测（账号节点是否欺诈）、内容分类（视频节点属于哪个品类）都是节点级。</p>\n<p>这里的预测必须是<strong>置换等变</strong>的（见 <a href=\"../foundations/graph-representation\">图表示</a>）：节点表示直接接一个共享的分类头即可。要注意的陷阱是<strong>数据划分</strong>——节点不独立，随机划分训练/测试节点时，测试节点的邻居可能在训练集里「泄露」了信息。直推式与归纳式两种设定下，划分方式还不一样（直推式所有节点结构都在场，归纳式测试节点训练时完全不可见）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边级任务-链接预测\">边级任务：链接预测</h2><p>边级任务预测一对节点之间是否该有边、或这条边是什么类型。这是推荐系统的数学本质——「用户会不会买这个商品」就是预测用户节点和商品节点之间的边。</p>\n<p>做法是先用 GNN 算出节点表示，再用一个<strong>打分函数</strong>组合两个端点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(i, j) = \\text{score}(h_i, h_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>打分函数可以是点积 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i^\\top h_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1352em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、拼接后过 MLP、或更复杂的双线性形式。训练的关键是<strong>负采样</strong>：图里只有正例（存在的边），得人为采样不存在的边当负例，否则模型会把一切都预测成「有边」。评测常用 Hits@K（正确边排进前 K 的比例）或 AUC。链接预测在推荐与知识图谱补全里的具体落地，见 <a href=\"recommendation-kg\">推荐与知识图谱</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"图级任务-读出与池化\">图级任务：读出与池化</h2><p>图级任务给整张图一个标签——一个分子有没有毒、一段程序有没有 bug。难点在于：图有任意多个节点，得把这堆节点表示汇总成一个<strong>固定维度的图向量</strong>，这一步叫<strong>读出（readout）<strong>或</strong>图池化</strong>。</p>\n<p>读出必须<strong>置换不变</strong>（见 <a href=\"../foundations/graph-representation\">图表示</a>）——换个节点编号，分子的毒性不能变。读出分两类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>平展池化</strong>：直接对所有节点表示求和/平均/最大。求和最常用且表达力最强（理由同 <a href=\"../foundations/message-passing\">消息传递</a> 里 GIN 的分析），平均对图大小鲁棒。</li>\n<li><strong>层次池化</strong>：像 CNN 的下采样一样，逐步把图「粗化」成更小的图（如 DiffPool、SAGPool），保留层次结构信息，对大图或有明显社区结构的图更有效。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>图级任务是 <a href=\"molecular-science\">分子与科学应用</a> 的主战场——分子性质预测几乎全是图级回归/分类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自监督与预训练\">自监督与预训练</h2><p>三种范式都面临标签稀缺的问题，于是<strong>图自监督</strong>近年大热：不用人工标签，而是从图本身造监督信号。常见任务有：掩码节点/边预测（盖住一部分让模型还原）、对比学习（同一张图的两个增强视图拉近、不同图推开，如 GraphCL/DGI）、上下文预测。预训练好的 GNN 再在下游任务上微调，在标签昂贵的分子领域尤其有用——这一思路在 <a href=\"molecular-science\">分子科学</a> 里会再次出现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>图学习任务归为三种范式：节点级（预测节点）、边级（预测节点对）、图级（预测整图）。</li>\n<li>范式决定输出处理：节点级直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（等变），边级组合端点 + 负采样，图级用 readout 汇总（不变）。</li>\n<li>节点级注意数据划分泄露与直推/归纳设定差异；边级靠负采样并用 Hits@K/AUC 评测。</li>\n<li>图级的核心是读出/池化（平展求和最强，层次池化保结构），是 <a href=\"molecular-science\">分子科学</a> 的主战场。</li>\n<li>自监督/预训练（掩码、对比学习）缓解标签稀缺，尤其利好分子领域。</li>\n<li>后两篇把这三种范式落到真实场景：<a href=\"recommendation-kg\">推荐与知识图谱</a>（节点/边级）、<a href=\"molecular-science\">分子科学</a>（图级）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"节点边图级任务","id":"节点边图级任务"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三种任务范式","id":"核心概念-三种任务范式"},{"level":2,"text":"节点级任务：分类与回归","id":"节点级任务-分类与回归"},{"level":2,"text":"边级任务：链接预测","id":"边级任务-链接预测"},{"level":2,"text":"图级任务：读出与池化","id":"图级任务-读出与池化"},{"level":2,"text":"自监督与预训练","id":"自监督与预训练"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"过平滑与深层 GNN","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/training/oversmoothing-depth"},"next":{"title":"推荐与知识图谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-neural-networks/applications/recommendation-kg"}}